/E (Every day, we are confronted with decisions, trade-offs and suboptimal situations which vary in magnitude and complexity. From habit adjustments to life-changing decisions, solving problems and knowing how to come up with effective solutions is an essential skill to develop, and one that is beneficial in our personal and professional lives.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
