/E (The purpose of this research is to identify if there is a significant difference between the amount of p-Akt and Akt after insulin stimulation when cells are administered a carbaryl concentration. This research aims to answer the question: does exposure to carbaryl impact the insulin signaling pathway leading to insulin resistance in 3T3-L1 cells? Given that carbaryl has been suggested to bind to receptors structurally similar to insulin receptors in 3D modeled research, I hypothesize the carbaryl will significantly decrease the levels of phosphorylated-Akt and Akt compared to cells not treated with carbaryl.)
/Pg 58 0 R
/K [7]
>>
