/S /P
/P 545 0 R
/E (Due to the lack of sufficient protein visualization in the p-Akt blot, which was necessary to demonstrate whether carbaryl directly blocks insulin reception as suggested by Popovska-Gorevski et al. \(2014\), conclusions cannot be drawn using that data. My results cannot indicate whether carbaryl binds to the insulin receptors on adipocytic cells.)
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [6]
>>
